Z||000007||FieroMaster88||06-14-2001||11:50 PM||||Our family had a YUGO for about a year...if that.  My dad had it for a comuter to and from work...it was in the shop about every 2 weeks and the engine gave out at 7,000 miles.  At least someone had good luck with one.......too bad it wasnt us!<P>------------------<BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">        <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe 30,000 miles  <IMG SRC="http://cwm.ragesofsanity.com/s/net4/smiling2.gif"> ||||reg||1
